-- The Echo server buffs, for rule Custom:PermanentServerBuffsEnabled (NMS's versions):
--   43002 Echo of Experience  +50% experience
--   43005 Echo of Selo        +10 run speed (up to 150)
--   36856 Echo of Power       HP, mana, AC, stats and haste
--   17779 Echo of Luck        a buff icon; with the rule on the zone also gives +50% experience (stock PEQ has an
